WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.134 --> 00:00:17.195
Bird and Kip looked around.

2
00:00:17.196 --> 00:00:19.792
Snow was everywhere.

3
00:00:19.793 --> 00:00:22.141
It covered the ground.

4
00:00:22.142 --> 00:00:25.785
It covered the tree branches.

5
00:00:25.786 --> 00:00:29.054
"Let's make a snowman!" said Kip.

6
00:00:29.055 --> 00:00:32.205
"That sounds like fun," said Bird.

7
00:00:32.206 --> 00:00:37.623
Kip made a snowball.

8
00:00:37.624 --> 00:00:40.712
He rolled the snowball in the snow.

9
00:00:40.713 --> 00:00:47.218
The snowball grew bigger and bigger.

10
00:00:47.219 --> 00:00:51.721
Bird made a snowball.

11
00:00:51.722 --> 00:00:54.383
She rolled the snowball in the snow.

12
00:00:54.384 --> 00:01:00.833
The snowball grew bigger and bigger.

13
00:01:00.834 --> 00:01:04.364
Bird and Kip lifted Bird's snowball.

14
00:01:04.365 --> 00:01:08.184
They put it onto Kip's snowball.

15
00:01:08.185 --> 00:01:12.863
Then they put a small snowball on top.

16
00:01:12.864 --> 00:01:16.772
"Our snowman is almost done," said Kip.

17
00:01:16.773 --> 00:01:22.778
"He needs a face and arms," said Bird.

18
00:01:22.779 --> 00:01:25.886
"I'll look for sticks," said Kip.

19
00:01:25.887 --> 00:01:32.803
"I'll look for pebbles," said Bird.

20
00:01:32.804 --> 00:01:39.833
As Kip walked around, the wind blew.

21
00:01:39.834 --> 00:01:42.779
It shook the branches.

22
00:01:42.780 --> 00:01:49.398
Snow fell on Kip's head.

23
00:01:49.399 --> 00:01:51.843
"Bird!" cried Kip.

24
00:01:51.844 --> 00:01:56.547
"Someone threw a snowball at me!"
